{"id":"ccbc12:problem:e-p1722","answer":"HONEYCOMB KINGDOM","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>这是一道Nonogram题，但是每一行的提示是摩尔斯密码。右上角的例题可以帮助你确定转换方式。</p>","text":"这是一道Nonogram题，但是每一行的提示是摩尔斯密码。右上角的例题可以帮助你确定转换方式。","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"能简化一下吗","html":"<p>这里是一张简化后的图片。</p>\n<p><img data-asset-id=\"asset-a4c720fa816a3ccbdd6ade7d\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/e/a0639e63b34a4705a1a8006b1eb4df33.webp\"/></p>","text":"这里是一张简化后的图片。","assetIds":["asset-a4c720fa816a3ccbdd6ade7d"]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>根据例题可以看出，这是一个变种nonogram：每一行的提示转成莫斯密码后对应这一行的格子分布：一格的深色格子对应“点”，两格以上的深色对应“划”，一格浅色对应点划之间的分割，两格以上的浅色对应字符之间的分割。根据推导出的规则可以解出谜题（一个合适的入手点是第二行的5E），深色格子象形得出答案：<strong>HONEYCOMB KINGDOM</strong>。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"答案参考\" data-asset-id=\"asset-fad438d830107444e35a8212\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1722.jpg\"/></p>","text":"根据例题可以看出，这是一个变种nonogram：每一行的提示转成莫斯密码后对应这一行的格子分布：一格的深色格子对应“点”，两格以上的深色对应“划”，一格浅色对应点划之间的分割，两格以上的浅色对应字符之间的分割。根据推导出的规则可以解出谜题（一个合适的入手点是第二行的5E），深色格子象形得出答案：\nHONEYCOMB KINGDOM\n。","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-fad438d830107444e35a8212"]},"extended":{"html":"<p>你得到了一个神秘的数字：8.16</p>","text":"你得到了一个神秘的数字：8.16","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-a4c720fa816a3ccbdd6ade7d","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/e/a0639e63b34a4705a1a8006b1eb4df33.webp","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/e/a0639e63b34a4705a1a8006b1eb4df33.webp","mime":"image/webp","size":2012718,"sha256":"36f8df82a3d9a54e8cad60bf97cd31eaf11b4e60fdf0a15857ce1e90ef2e7a75","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["puzzle"],"contexts":["hint:2"]},{"id":"asset-fad438d830107444e35a8212","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1722.jpg","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/e-1722.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":116008,"sha256":"33d1892019bdc3d67aef0750015e3b3cd082bff8b48fc69191a25b1a85e429c1","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
